'''Gutrot''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Gutrot's Species|unknown species]] from an unknown planet.

==Appearance==
===Ben as Gutrot===
Gutrot has the appearance of a mechanical humanoid in a green and white outfit, with the exception of his head and shoulders being a bluish-purple color with black spots. His eyes are green and he has four fingers on each white gloved hand, which are equipped with green and white vambraces and arm length black sleeve covers. He has nozzles or openings, from which he can eject gas. He has two on each of his forearms, one on each shoulder, three on the white and black rim between his shoulders and neck, three on his head, one on his back and one in the center of his posterior. He has a green belt with white stripes, black accents, and a window on his stomach so that the gas he uses can be seen.

Gutrot wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on what appears to be some kind of gas mask in front of his mouth.

===Nega Ben as Nega Gutrot===
[[Nega Ben]]'s Gutrot looks the same as [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s, except the green parts of his outfit are recolored a dulled blue, his skin is pink, and his eyes and [[Negatrix]] symbol are white.

