==Personality==
Gutrot speaks with a [[Wikipedia:Brooklyn|Brooklyn]] accent and a gruff tone that gives him a rather tough yet easygoing "wise guy" sort of vibe. He also has a cynical sense of humor, and is usually pretty calm and level-headed.

