{{Quote|Your innards are a walking chemical laboratory... You have the ability to combine various chemicals and expel them as gas!|[[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Future Dr. Animo]] explaining Gutrot's abilities.<ref name="Animo Crackers"/>}}
Gutrot's innards contain various gaseous elements, making him a "walking chemical laboratory".<ref>[[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Future Dr. Animo]]</ref><ref name="Animo Crackers"/>

Gutrot has the ability to make compounds of almost any type and expel them as gas from the various nozzles on his body for both offense and defense. The strength of these gases depends on the amount expelled and their chemical makeup.

Technically speaking, Gutrot can generate just about any kind of chemical gas imaginable,{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Can Many Any Kind of Gas.png]]|group = DJW|name = gas}} including:
*'''Sulphur Dioxide''', a highly combustible and toxic gas that can be used as a form of tear gas.<ref name="Animo Crackers" />
*'''Nitrous Oxide''', more commonly known as "laughing gas", which can be used to incapacitate an opponent by making them laugh uncontrollably.<ref name="Animo Crackers" />
*'''Fluoromethyl-hexafluoroisopropyl-ether''', also known as "Sevoflurane". While it is normally used as an anesthetic, it is also useful as a knockout gas with short-term memory loss as a side-effect.<ref name="Animo Crackers" />
*'''Hydrogen Chloride''', an acidic and corrosive gas that can burn or melt through solid materials such as a [[Segmentasapien (Classic)|Segmentasapien]]'s constructs.<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref>
*'''Dichlorodiethyl Sulfide''', more commonly known as the "mustard gas". Exposure to this gas is corrosive to the eyes, skin, and lungs and leads to blindness and blistering of the skin, and can cause severe and sometimes fatal respiratory damage. Although not used, Gutrot can potentially generate this gas.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Deadly Gasses.png]]|group = DJW|name = mustard}}
*'''Hydrogen Cyanide''', also known as "prussic acid", a colorless gas with a strong pungent odor that causes irritation of the eyes and respiratory tract, as well as toxic systemic effects. Although not used, Gutrot can potentially generate this gas.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = mustard}}
*'''Sleeping Gas''', although not used, this gas was mentioned by Gutrot and was about to be used against the [[Krakken]].<ref name="Vreedlemania">''[[Vreedlemania]]''</ref>

Gutrot can absorb gas by pulling it through his nozzles.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Can Pull Gases Through His Nozzles.PNG]]|group = DJW}} Likewise, he can intake and get rid of harmful gases.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Intake Gases.png]]|group = DJW}}

If Gutrot creates a gas inside his body, then discovers he no longer needs it, he can simply "neutralize" it instead of releasing it.<ref name="Vreedlemania" />

Being able to absorb and neutralize any gas, Gutrot is immune to poisonous{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Poison Gas Immunity.PNG]]|group = DJW}} and acidic{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Acid Gas Immunity.PNG]]|group = DJW}} gases, as he can inhale them and break them down into something harmless. He is also immune to a [[Nemuina]]'s sleep dust.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Immune To Pesky Dust.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

Gutrot has a very advanced knowledge of chemistry, as well as some degree of knowledge on a species' biology. This allows him to create a gas that can specifically target the species in question. For example, he can create a pheromone designed to attract [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustars]], causing them to follow Gutrot wherever he wishes to direct them.<ref name="WXIP2">''[[Weapon XI: Part 2]]''</ref> His intelligence seems to be innate since, similar to some of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s other intelligent aliens, he may not fully understand what he is talking about from his point of view. Furthermore, Gutrot seems to be very intelligent in general, as he discussed the ramifications of time travel and that hitting someone on the head would simply result in a concussion rather than amnesia.<ref name="Animo Crackers" />

Gutrot can jump exceptionally high, being able to leap over the buildings in [[Los Soledad]].<ref name="ATTWN" />

Gutrot can survive in the vacuum of space.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot In Space.png]]|group = DJW}}

==Weaknesses==
When Gutrot uses his gases, they make a large cloud, which is susceptible to prevailing winds. This can endanger allies, as well as innocent bystanders.<ref name="Animo Crackers"/>

Gutrot cannot replicate the [[Fountain of Youth (Classic)|Fountain of Youth]]'s water as a form of steam.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Cannot Make HO12 Steam.png]]|group = DJW}}

Despite being able to absorb gases, Gutrot cannot absorb an Ectonurite in wisp form.{{Refn|[[:File:Ghostfreak Gas Absorption Immunity.png]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Gutrot first appeared in ''[[Animo Crackers]]'', where he defeated [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] and [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Future Animo]].{{Refn|Despite first being used in ''[[Animo Crackers]]'', Gutrot was never locked in the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]].{{Refn|[[:File:New Aliens in OV Weren't Locked.png]]|group = DJW}}|group = note}}
*In ''[[Weapon XI: Part 2]]'', Gutrot lured two [[Way Bad]]s to the [[Rooter Headquarters]] and attempted to fight [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]], but was quickly defeated and reverted back to [[Human (Classic)|human]] when Kevin [[Weapon XI (Present)|absorbed some power]] from the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]].
* In ''[[Vreedlemania]]'', Gutrot prepared to stop the [[Krakken]], but [[Isosceles Right Triangle Vreedle|Sceles]] stopped it first. He then witnessed the reunion of [[Ma Vreedle|Ma]] and [[Pa Vreedle]] before reverting.
* In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Gutrot appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===Nega Ben's Timeline===
*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', [[Nega Ben|Nega]] Gutrot tried to capture [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] only to be blocked by [[Build-A-Guy]] and then wiped out by the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]].
*In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', Nega Gutrot was brought back into existence by No Watch Ben as [[Clockwork]].

