==Etymology==
Gutrot's name is a reference to "Rotgut" (also his working name), a name shared by several fictional characters. Rotgut is also a Prohibition-era slang term for homemade alcoholic beverages, alluding to Gutrot's ability to mix chemicals inside himself. "Gut rot" is also a slang for "stomachache".

==Trivia==
*Technically speaking, Gutrot's name was revealed by the [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|future Dr. Animo]].
*Ironically, chemistry is one of Ben's weaker subjects, though Gutrot seems to be an expert on it.<ref name="Animo Crackers" />
*Gutrot can generate any gas seen in cartoons and comics, including a gaseous form of truth serum. However, there are some gases he may have to see to know how to make.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = gas}}
**Gutrot is probably immune to freezing gases. However, he would still be vulnerable to gases as strong as liquid nitrogen.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = freeze}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with Gutrot,{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up With Bullfrag and Gutrot.png]]|group = DJW}} having modeled his appearance and powers after [[bulbapedia:Koffing (Pokémon)|Koffing]],{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Based on Koffing.png]]|group = DJW}} which was his favorite Pokémon.{{Refn|[[:File:Koffing was DJWs favorite pokemon proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Gutrot went under the working name Rotgut.{{Refn|[[:File:Rotgut Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Gutrot's voice was inspired by Peter Falk's [[wikipedia:Columbo (character)|Columbo]] character.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Voice Inspiration.png]]|group = DJW}} He even squints his right eye like Peter Falk, who had a glass eye since the age of three, and was known for his trademark squint.
*When asked if he could create the [[Kraab (Classic)|Kraab]]'s Protoplasm Freezing Spray, Derrick answered possibly.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Can Replicate Kraab's Liquid.png]]|group = DJW}}
*When asked if he could create a freezing gas, Derrick answered probably, but mentioned that he wouldn't be immune to a freezing gas as strong as liquid nitrogen.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Vulnerable to Liquid Nitrogen.png]]|group = DJW|name = freeze}}
*When asked if he could create a cure for [[wikipedia:COVID-19|COVID-19]], Derrick answered that Gutrot could make a sterilizing gas but not a vaccine.{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot COVID-19.png]]|group = DJW}}

